WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,380
Is it like the day after tomorrow?

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:06,020
Will there be a small Qiantian innate? Have you heard about it? The barrier is urgent.

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:08,020
Five people and eighteen steps unite together

4
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:19,470
Eight hundred thousand troops marched south to besiege the pass. Where is General Li?

5
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:22,180
General Chen

6
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:24,860
Let me ask you about General Li. General Li?

7
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:27,740
I'm dead, I'm dead

8
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,110
The barbarians attacked the city seven days ago

9
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:35,310
General Li went up to the city wall and Du Zhan was shot by Liu Shi. He was too seriously injured and did not survive.

10
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:36,630
He was still shouting in front of Lin Zhong

11
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:44,290
Don't tell Hu Maduyan to kill General Chen and come back. General Chen, General Li, Pu Du

12
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:47,650
When I read the letter, I no longer recognized my husband Kong.

13
00:00:47,930 --> 00:00:48,890
don't be sad

14
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:51,130
The general died in a hundred battles

15
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:52,410
This life is enough

16
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:54,090
only regret

17
00:00:54,330 --> 00:01:15,630
I haven't been able to see you again. Yi Minghuai said what happened. General Chen Huai said he was missing.

18
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:16,990
That battle was too brutal

19
00:01:17,110 --> 00:01:18,150
Can't even find the bodies

20
00:01:18,350 --> 00:01:19,950
Someone saw him surrounded by barbarians

21
00:01:20,070 --> 00:01:21,230
Then I couldn't find it

22
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:23,480
I can't find anyone alive.

23
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:28,260
Die without seeing Xi Pulu

24
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:30,100
Mom has been dreaming these days

25
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:31,980
Dreaming about an immortal riding a crane

26
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:33,380
Fly down from the sky

27
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:34,620
Pick up your brother

28
00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:36,260
That crane is so white and big

29
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,300
Your brother is sitting on it

30
00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:38,860
Is it right to look back at your mother?

31
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:42,500
He was picked up by an immortal, right?
